      "observations": [
        "Descriptor identity includes resources and worker-template SHA; each release is published under bundleId. Runtime resolves resource and marker URLs relative to the worker location; cache lookup is restricted to its bundle prefix and marker identities.",
        "Activation claims clients without skipWaiting or deleting other cache versions. Explicit repair only removes its own failed staging cache; full successful repairs preserve older caches."
      ],
      "evidence": "../offline-worker.txt: new complete version preserves old version and unrelated caches; explicit repair/failure and window-race cases"
    },
